		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d24r0901_swbell_12"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>えええ！　あなぬけのヒモを
つかわれたら　はぐれちゃうよお？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T09:52:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T08:38:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>えええ！　あなぬけのヒモを
使われたら　はぐれちゃうよお？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T09:52:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T08:38:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
